 "offset_seconds": -2.0200000000002127,
 "words_heard": 217,
 "words": 232,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "He saw the crowds and climbed the mountain, sat down on the ground",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His followers came close to him, the people gathered round",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He looked upon the weary ones, the poor and the oppressed",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And he began to teach them, saying who is truly blessed",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are the poor in spirit, for theirs is the kingdom of heaven",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are those who mourn, for they will be comforted",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are the meek, for they will inherit the earth",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The widow at the graveside and the farmer in the drought",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The ones who long for justice while the powerful shut them out",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The ones who pardon freely and the hearts that hold no lie",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The ones who build a bridge of peace where angry words go by",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are those who hunger and thirst for righteousness, for they will be filled",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are the merciful, for they will receive mercy",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are the pure in heart, for they will see God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are the peacemakers, for they will be called sons of God",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are you when people insult you and persecute you",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Rejoice and be glad, for your reward is great in heaven",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are the poor in spirit, for theirs is the kingdom of heaven",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are those who mourn, for they will be comforted",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blessed are the meek, for they will inherit the earth",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Theirs is the kingdom of heaven",
   "heard": 6,
